OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does Hollywood come to
OL,4,ABerkshire?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelling along the M4 near Junction
OL,7,F11, just outside Shinfield near
OL,8,FReading, you cannot miss a vast complex
OL,9,Fof grey buildings.
OL,11,FFrom the outside, they may not look
OL,12,Fparticularly exciting, but behind their
OL,13,Fwalls some of the world's biggest film
OL,14,Fand television productions are being
OL,15,Fmade.
OL,17,FShadowbox Studios Shinfield, in
OL,18,FWokingham, has 18 state-of-the-art
OL,19,Fsound stages, including two with more
OL,20,Fthan 40,000 sq ft of floor space each.
